{"id":"a-inf-2808","category":"info","cover":"","region":"global","publishedAt":"2025-09-13","addedAt":"2026-10-13T11:56:48.073Z","tags":[],"title":{"zh":"25年1月 一大波投影灯赏析","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"前言：超丰富投影灯合集，值得收藏！Audi A6 e-tron Concept前后灯都采用极其平滑的outlens，似乎是一种新趋势，强调简约科技。\n\n视频里展示了转向灯投影、游戏","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"前言：超丰富投影灯合集，值得收藏！Audi A6 e-tron Concept前后灯都采用极其平滑的outlens，似乎是一种新趋势，强调简约科技。\n\n视频里展示了转向灯投影、游戏屏幕投影、开门警示功能。↓，时长00:43Audi e-tron前后灯都采用极其平滑的outlens，似乎是一种新趋势，强调简约科技。\n\nAudi A8，时长02:26Audi Q6 e-tron\n\nAudi S5 Sedan\n\nAudi urbansphere concept\n\nBAIC Beijing BJ30\n\nBentley Continental GT Speed\n\nBMW\n\nBMW 5-Series\n\n白光下似乎只能看到前半截图案，后半截几乎不可见了。\n\nBMW iX1\n\nBMW iX2\n\nBMW X3\n\nInfiniti QX80\n\nMercedes-Benz E-Class\n\nMercedes-Benz S-Class\n\n，时长02:31Mini Aceman Concept\n\nMini next 100 concept\n\n精彩尽在视频中，不容错过。↓，时长02:30Nissan Patrol\n\nFord Capri\n\nSkoda-Slavia_Concept\n\nVolkswagen Taigo\n\n别克GL8 Avenir\n\n智己L7\n\n高合可爱的行人监测标识。\n\n左侧变线危险提示标识。\n\n后备箱开启指令触发区域标识。\n\n具体使用方式请看下方视频。另外视频末尾展示了屏幕投影功能在地库环境下的情形，环境真是太恶劣了，啥也看不清。，时长00:36Smart 精灵5#Smart 5#的投影灯还有翻盖保护，炫！，时长00:24——本月分享到此结束，谢谢观赏——","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/zaoxing/2808.html","author":""},"content":[{"t":"text","v":"前言：超丰富投影灯合集，值得收藏！Audi A6 e-tron Concept前后灯都采用极其平滑的outlens，似乎是一种新趋势，强调简约科技。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johic2qJhKmick4LHXUSzQgSRJBNOhv27icU7sCy36BOIDhWF5OzibEIbDf8kw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicIxkdjH8m51RdCjkDA9ibQpqFslsNfPsFwC1sqmcCAVmqcZZUbEf2gKw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaMok6Wk24E02H8XdRf4johicDEnMiaU4EpHX78nPBCK1aje2yTXcbicajiaeKHByxKMLHNjrRaMaYQRwg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg"},{"t":"text","v":"视频里展示了转向灯投影、游戏屏幕投影、开门警示功能。↓，时长00:43Audi e-tron前后灯都采用极其平滑的outlens，似乎是一种新趋